Anywhere from Dlvl 1 down to the VS level, excluding branches.  Only a 
player invoking the EotA is able to go to a different branch directly. 
NPC's can only hit branch levels by following the PC or being somehow 
generated there.  If you have detect treasure or a potion of object 
detection, use that first on the level where you dispatched the wizard. 
  If you don't see a spellbook, then levelport to Dlvl 1 and work your 
way down would be my advice.  You'll hit more levels in a brief amount 
of time that way.

You use telepathy, and since you're near the end of the game, you're a 
tank, so just 'DfV' your way down until you find the Wiz.

